#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "\"%(site)s\" is pronounced identically to the standard English word \"ruckus\""
msgstr "\"%(site)s\" se izgovarja enako kot standardna angleška beseda \"truckus\""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "\"Ruqqie\" is pronounced \"RUCK-ee\""
msgstr "Ruqqie se izgovori ruck-ee"

#. a cryptocurrency's name, then the word for the address to send it to.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(coin)s Address"
msgstr "%(coin)s Naslov"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(coin)s receiving address QR code"
msgstr "%(coin)s naslov prejema QR koda"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(company)s is outside your jurisdiction. Sucks to be you."
msgstr "%(company)s je izven vaše pristojnosti. Bedno je biti ti."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(company)s is, always has been, and always will be 100%% outside your jurisdiction. You must obtain legal process that is valid in the state of New Hampshire. Then, submit your United States legal process document to our [legal requests portal](/legal)."
msgstr "%(company)s je, vedno je bil in vedno bo 100 %% izven vaše pristojnosti. Pridobiti morate pravni postopek, ki velja v državi New Hampshire. Nato pošljite svoj pravni procesni dokument Združenih držav na naš [pravni portal za zahteve](/legal)."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(company)s may revoke your License at any time and for any reason."
msgstr "%(company)s lahko dovoljenje prekliče kadarkoli in iz kakršnega koli razloga."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(curation)s: a public curation, by its name or the short name under it. Search %(curation)s to find them; <code>%(in_curation)s</code> narrows a post search to that curation's guilds and accounts. Private curations are never found."
msgstr "%(curation)s: javna kurirana krma, po imenu ali skrajšanem imenu pod njo. Iskanje %(curation)s najti jih; <code>%(in_curation)s</code> Zoži iskanje po tem curated feed's Guilds in računov. Zasebnih kuriranih virov ne najdemo."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s - Contact"
msgstr "%(site)s - Kontakt"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s - FAQ"
msgstr "%(site)s - FAQ"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s - Formatting"
msgstr "%(site)s - Oblikovanje"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s - OAuth2"
msgstr "%(site)s - OAuth2"

#. "Press" here means news reporters and the media.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s - Press"
msgstr "%(site)s - Pritisnite"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s - Siege Guild"
msgstr "%(site)s - Prevzem zahteva Guild"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s Admins"
msgstr "%(site)s Skrbniki"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s FAQ"
msgstr "%(site)s FAQ"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s Formatting"
msgstr "%(site)s Oblikovanje"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s OAuth2 Guide"
msgstr "%(site)s OAuth2 Guide"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s Press Resources"
msgstr "%(site)s Tiskovni viri"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s Signature Verification"
msgstr "%(site)s Preverjanje podpisa"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s chat supports [markdown formatting](/help/formatting)."
msgstr "%(site)s klepet podpira [označevanje formatiranja](/help/formatting)."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s chooses to implement only minimal rules. Almost all First-Amendment-protected speech is permitted on %(site)s."
msgstr "%(site)s se odloči za izvajanje minimalnih pravil. Skoraj ves govor, zaščiten pred prvo spremembo, je dovoljen na %(site)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s is an open-source platform for online communities, free of censorship and moderator abuse by design."
msgstr "%(site)s je odprtokodna platforma za spletne skupnosti, brez cenzure in moderatorskih zlorab po zasnovi."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s is an open-source platform that powers independent online communities."
msgstr "%(site)s je odprtokodna platforma, ki napaja neodvisne spletne skupnosti."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s is an open-source web app that lets you enjoy online communities focused around topics you love, without censorship and moderator abuse."
msgstr "%(site)s je odprtokodna spletna aplikacija, ki vam omogoča uživati v spletnih skupnostih, osredotočenih na teme, ki jih imate radi, brez cenzure in zlorabe moderatorjev."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s is broken into numerous smaller messaging and commenting boards focused around a variety of topics. These boards are called \"Guilds\". Guild names always start with a `+` symbol, and are usually (though not always) named after their topic of interest. For example, [+news](/+news) is a Guild focused on sharing and discussion of news and current events."
msgstr "%(site)s je razdeljen na številne manjše plošče za sporočanje in komentarje, osredotočene na različne teme. Te deske se imenujejo \"Globe\". Imena krivde se vedno začnejo s `+` simbol, in so običajno (čeprav ne vedno) poimenovani po njihovi zanimivi temi. Na primer, [+news](/+news) je Guild osredotočen na delitev in razpravo o novicah in aktualnih dogodkih."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s titles are text-based, cosmetic achievements that can be displayed next to your username across the %(site)s platform. Titles may be earned through various activities on %(site)s: earning rep, inviting friends, helping staff, and more."
msgstr "Naslovi %(site)s so na besedilu temelječi kozmetični dosežki, ki se lahko prikažejo poleg vašega uporabniškega imena po vsej platformi %(site)s. Naslovi se lahko zaslužijo z različnimi dejavnostmi na %(site)s: pridobivanje ugleda, vabilo prijateljev, pomoč osebju, in še več."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s: Awesome Online Communities, Without Censorship"
msgstr "%(site)s: Super spletne skupnosti, brez cenzure"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "**Every automated post carries the robot mark**, people who turn on **Hide bot content** don't see them, and your profile says **Some posts are automated**. Your own posts carry no mark."
msgstr "**Vsaka avtomatizirana objava nosi robotsko oznako**, ljudje, ki vklopijo **Skrij vsebino bota** jih ne vidijo, vaš profil pa pravi **Nekatere objave so avtomatizirane**. Lastne objave ne nosijo nobenega znaka."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "**Your feeds can't get your account suspended.** When a feed repeats itself, that item simply isn't posted. Your own posts are judged on their own, as before."
msgstr "Vaši podatki ne morejo vzeti vašega računa. Ko se vir ponovi, ta točka preprosto ni objavljena. Tvoja lastna delovna mesta se presojajo kot prej."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "**Your own account** can post from feeds too, while you keep using it as yourself: see [below](#own-account)."
msgstr "** Tudi vaš račun** lahko objavite od virov, medtem ko ga uporabljate kot sami: glejte [spodaj](#own-account)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "**Your server only orders.** Every post it names goes through the same rules as any feed before it is shown: removed posts, private guilds, each viewer's word filter and blocks. A post a viewer may not see is simply left out."
msgstr "** Vaš strežnik samo ukazuje.** Vsaka objava, ki jo ime gre skozi ista pravila kot vsak vir, preden je prikazano: odstranjene objave, zasebne guldne, vsak gledalec besedo filter in bloke. Postava, ki je gledalec morda ne vidi, je preprosto izpuščena."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<code>\"black cat\"</code>: posts with those words together, in that order."
msgstr "<code>\"black cat\"</code>: posts s temi besedami skupaj, v tem vrstnem redu."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>#gaming</code>: a topic, one of the site's categories or subcategories (Arts, Gaming, News, Film &amp; TV: letters and numbers only, so <code>#filmtv</code>). Search <code>#gam</code> to find the guilds in the topics with that in their name; <code>%(in_topic)s</code> narrows a post search to them."
msgstr "<code>#gaming</code>: tema, ena od kategorij ali podkategorij strani (umetnosti, igre na srečo, novice, film &amp; TV: samo črke in številke, tako da <code>#filmtv</code>). Iskanje <code>#gam</code> najti cehov v temah s tem v njihovem imenu; <code>%(in_topic)s</code> Zoži iskanje po pošti."

#. each example is a search as it is typed: it stays as it is
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>%(example)s</code>: Alice's polls."
msgstr "<code>%(example)s</code>Alenkine ankete."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>%(example)s</code>: links to example.com in +news this year."
msgstr "<code>%(example)s</code>: povezave na primer.com v +news letos."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>%(example)s</code>: recipes in Spanish, each post once."
msgstr "<code>%(example)s</code>: recepti v španščini, vsaka objava enkrat."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>%(example)s</code>: videos in any guild about gaming."
msgstr "<code>%(example)s</code>: videi v vsakem guldnu o igrah na srečo."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>%(example)s</code>: well-discussed posts about open source."
msgstr "<code>%(example)s</code>: dobro diskusirani objav o odprtokodni."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>%(from_op)s</code> never finds an account's anonymous posts, and <code>%(not_from)s</code> never hides them. Nobody can find out who wrote an anonymous post by searching."
msgstr "<code>%(from_op)s</code> nikoli ne najde anonimnih objav in <code>%(not_from)s</code> Nikoli jih ne skrivaj. Nihče ne more izvedeti, kdo je napisal anonimno sporočilo z iskanjem."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<code>+pets</code>: a guild. Search <code>+pets</code> to find guilds with that in their name."
msgstr "<code>+pets</code>: a guild. Iskanje <code>+pets</code> Da bi našli cehe s tem v njihovem imenu."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>-%(key)s:</code> leaves them out"
msgstr "<code>-%(key)s:</code> Pusti jih zunaj."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<code>-dogs</code> or <code>-\"hot dogs\"</code>: leaves out posts with that word or those words."
msgstr "<code>-dogs</code> ali <code>-\"hot dogs\"</code>: opušča objave s to besedo ali te besede."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<code>@alice</code>: an account. Search <code>@alice</code> to find accounts."
msgstr "<code>@alice</code>: račun. Iskanje <code>@alice</code> najti račune."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<code>black cat</code>: posts with both words, anywhere in the title or the text."
msgstr "<code>black cat</code>: objave z obema besedama, kjerkoli v naslovu ali besedilu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<strong>GIFs and photos:</strong> GIPHY, Tenor and Flickr."
msgstr "<strong>GIFs in fotografije:</strong> GIPHY, Tenor In Flickr."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<strong>Music and podcasts:</strong> Spotify, SoundCloud, Apple Music, Apple Podcasts, Bandcamp, Mixcloud and Deezer show their player; nothing plays until you press it."
msgstr "<strong>Glasba in podcasti:</strong> Spotify, SoundCloud, Apple Music, Apple Podcasts, Bandcamp, Mixcloud in Deezer kažejo svojega igralca; nič ne igra, dokler ga pritisnete."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<strong>Posts</strong> on X, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads, Instagram, Reddit, Tumblr, Pinterest, Telegram and Truth Social show as a card with who wrote it and what they wrote. A Facebook post shows the page it is from; its text stays on Facebook."
msgstr "<strong>Delovna mesta</strong> na X, Bluesky, Mastodon, niti, Instagram, Reddit, Tumblr, Pinterest, Telegram ter Truth Social Prikaži kot kartico s tem, kdo jo je napisal in kaj so napisali. A Facebook objava prikazuje stran, ki je iz; njeno besedilo ostane na Facebook."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<strong>Videos play in the post:</strong> YouTube, Vimeo, Dailymotion, Twitch, Kick, Rumble, Odysee, BitChute, Bilibili, Streamable, Loom and TED; Facebook videos and reels, Instagram reels and TikTok videos play when you press play."
msgstr "<strong>Video posnetki predvajajo v post:</strong> YouTube, Vimeo, Dailymotion, Twitch, Kick, Rumble, Odisee, BitChute, Bililibili, Streamble, Loom in TED; Facebook videoposnetke in kolute, Instagram koluti in TikTok video posnetki igrajo, ko pritisnete predvajanje."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A **bot** is an account that posts by itself. The site's admins approve every one before it posts anything, and every bot follows the same posting rules, and the [rules for bots](/help/rules#bots) in the Rules and Guidelines."
msgstr "A **bot** je račun, ki ga objavi sam. Upravitelji spletne strani odobravajo vse, preden objavi karkoli, in vsak robot sledi istim pravilom objavljanja, in [pravila za robote](/help/rules#bots) v Pravilih in smernicah."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A **member bot** needs its member to run it: a script of their own with a **bot key** (for example for X), or a source they pay for. It stays the member's, they manage it, and its profile says **Automated by @member**. A member bot may read approved feeds too."
msgstr "A **članski bot** potrebuje svojega člana, da ga vodi: lastno pisavo s **bot ključem** (na primer za X), ali vir, ki ga plačajo. Ostane član, oni ga upravljajo, njegov profil pa pravi ** Avtomatizirano z @member**. Član robot lahko bere tudi odobrene vire."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A **site bot** costs nothing to run: it reads free feeds (below). Anyone can propose one, and once an admin approves it, it is the **site's**: the admins run it, it is linked to nobody, and its profile says **Automated by %(site)s**. A BBC headlines bot is a site bot."
msgstr "A **site bot** ne stane nič teči: bere proste vire (spodaj). Vsak lahko predlaga enega, in ko ga admin odobri, je to ** mesto**: administratorji ga vodijo, je povezan z nikomer, in njegov profil pravi ** Avtomatizirano z %(site)s**. BBC naslovnice bot je stran bot."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A JSON object with the posts, best first, and optionally a cursor to ask for more:"
msgstr "Predmet JSON z objavami, najboljši najprej, in po želji kurzor, da zahteva več:"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A bot that breaks the site's rules is paused or banned like any account, and so is the member running it when the bot was the point."
msgstr "Bot, ki krši pravila strani je zastala ali prepovedana kot vsak račun, in tako je član, ki ga vodi, ko je bil robot točka."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A bot that needs a key or a paid source is a member bot; one that only reads free feeds can be a site bot."
msgstr "Bot, ki potrebuje ključ ali plačan vir je član bot; tisti, ki bere samo proste vire, je lahko stran bot."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A bot's posts are on its own profile, like everyone's. It can forward them to up to %(num)s guilds, and each guild's own rules apply: a guild can refuse forwards from bots, and one that only takes forwards from approved contributors needs the bot to be one. When a guild refuses, the post stays on the bot's profile."
msgid_plural "A bot's posts are on its own profile, like everyone's. It can forward them to up to %(num)s guilds, and each guild's own rules apply: a guild can refuse forwards from bots, and one that only takes forwards from approved contributors needs the bot to be one. When a guild refuses, the post stays on the bot's profile."
msgstr[0] "Postave robota so na svojem profilu, kot vsi. Posreduje jih lahko do %(num)s guldnov in veljajo pravila vsakega guldna: guld lahko zavrne naprej od robotov, in tisti, ki prevzame le od odobrenih prispevajočih potrebuje bot za eno. Ko guld odkloni, ostane post na profilu robota."
msgstr[1] "Postave robota so na svojem profilu, kot vsi. Lahko jih posreduje do %(num)s guldna in veljajo pravila vsakega guldna: ceh lahko zavrne naprej od robotov, in tisti, ki prevzame le od odobrenih prispevajočih potrebuje bot, da je eden. Ko guld odkloni, ostane post na profilu robota."
msgstr[2] "Postave robota so na svojem profilu, kot vsi. Lahko jih posreduje do %(num)s guldne in veljajo pravila vsakega guldna: ceh lahko zavrne naprej od robotov, in tisti, ki prevzame le od odobrenih prispevajočih potrebuje bot, da je eden. Ko guld odkloni, ostane post na profilu robota."
msgstr[3] "Postave robota so na svojem profilu, kot vsi. Lahko jih posreduje do %(num)s guldnov, in veljajo pravila vsakega guldna: Guild lahko zavrne naprej od robotov, in tisti, ki prevzema le od odobrenih prispevajočih potrebuje bot, da je eden. Ko guld odkloni, ostane post na profilu robota."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A comment search needs a word of at least 3 letters, or <code>%(from_op)s</code> or <code>%(in_op)s</code>."
msgstr "iskanje komentarja zahteva vsaj tri črke ali <code>%(from_op)s</code> ali <code>%(in_op)s</code>."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A complete example"
msgstr "Popoln primer"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A curation normally picks and orders its posts with rules its owner sets on the site. Instead, a curation can name a **feed server**: a small web service that you (or someone you trust) run, which answers with the posts to show and the order to show them in. How your server decides is up to you."
msgstr "Kurirana krma običajno izbira in naroča svoja delovna mesta s pravili, ki jih lastnik postavlja na gradbišču. Namesto, kuriran vir lahko imenuje ** feed strežnik**: majhna spletna storitev, ki jo (ali nekdo, ki mu zaupate) teči, ki odgovarja s objavami, da se prikaže in naročilo, da jih pokaže v. Kako se vaš strežnik odloči, je odvisno od vas."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A failure by %(site)s in one or more instances to insist upon your strict adherence to these licence terms, shall not be construed as a waiver of any continuing or subsequent violations of these license terms."
msgstr "Če %(site)s v enem ali več primerih ne vztrajate pri strogem spoštovanju teh licenčnih pogojev, se ne razlaga kot opustitev kakršnih koli nadaljnjih ali naknadnih kršitev teh licenčnih pogojev."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A feed a member adds to a running bot waits for an admin. Removing one takes effect at once."
msgstr "Krmilo član doda, da teče robot čaka na admin. Odstranitev enega začne veljati takoj."

#. floor and quiet are minutes (the shortest and the longest wait between two
#. reads of a feed), per_run is a number of items, daily a number of posts
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A feed is read as often as it safely can be: every %(floor)s minutes at most, or less often if the feed asks to be (most news feeds say 15 minutes), and less often again while it has nothing new (up to every %(quiet)s minutes). A feed that asks us to slow down is left alone for as long as it says. New items are posted oldest first, at most %(per_run)s from one feed at a time and %(daily)s a day for the whole bot."
msgstr "Krma se bere tako pogosto, kot je lahko varna: največ vsake %(floor)s minute, ali manj pogosto, če je vir zahteva (večinoma novice pravijo 15 minut), in redkeje spet, medtem ko nima nič novega (do vsake %(quiet)s minute). Krma, ki nas prosi, naj upočasnimo, ostane sama, dokler piše. Novi predmeti so objavljeni najstarejši najprej, največ %(per_run)s iz enega vira naenkrat in %(daily)s na dan za celotno bot."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A feed that keeps failing (%(num)s times in a row) stops and the member running it is told; start it again from Settings > Bots once it works."
msgid_plural "A feed that keeps failing (%(num)s times in a row) stops and the member running it is told; start it again from Settings > Bots once it works."
msgstr[0] "Krmilo, ki ne deluje (%(num)s krat zapored), se ustavi in član, ki ga upravlja, je napovedan; zaženi ga znova iz Nastavitve > Bots, ko bo delovalo."
msgstr[1] "Krmilo, ki še vedno ne deluje (%(num)s krat zapored) se ustavi in član, ki ga upravlja, je napovedan; začni znova z Nastavitve > Bots, ko bo delovalo."
msgstr[2] "Vir, ki še naprej ne deluje (%(num)s krat zapored) ustavi in član, ki teče je navedeno; začnite znova iz Nastavitve > Bots, ko bo delovalo."
msgstr[3] "Vir, ki še naprej ne deluje (%(num)s krat zapored) se ustavi in član, ki ga upravlja, je napovedan; zaženi ga znova iz Nastavitve > Bots, ko bo delovalo."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A member bot can also post from a script of its member's own, through a **bot key**. This is how to run a bot for **X**: X has no feeds, and its terms don't allow other sites to scrape it, so use your own X access in your own script and post each tweet's link. The site shows a link to a tweet as X's own embed, so no tweet text is copied. Site bots have no keys."
msgstr "Član bot lahko objavi tudi iz scenarija svojega člana, preko **bot ključa**. Tako se zažene robot za **X**: X nima virov in njegovi pogoji ne dovoljujejo drugim spletnim mestom, da ga strgajo, zato uporabite lasten dostop X v svojem scenariju in objavite vsako povezavo tweeta. Spletna stran prikazuje povezavo do tweeta, kot je X's lastno vdelano, zato ni prepisano nobeno tweet besedilo. Stranski roboti nimajo ključev."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A post always belongs to its author's profile first. Anyone can \"Forward\" it into other Guilds for community-scoped discussion - each Guild a post is forwarded to gets its own independent copy, with its own votes and its own comments. Users can add comments to posts or to other comments."
msgstr "Postava vedno najprej pripada avtorjevemu profilu. Vsakdo ga lahko \"Forward\" v druge Guilds za skupnostno-skopsko razpravo - vsak Guild se pošlje post, da dobi svojo samostojno kopijo, s svojimi glasovi in svojimi komentarji. Uporabniki lahko dodate pripombe na objav ali drugih pripomb."

#. parts is the most words and operators a search can hold, chars the most
#. characters
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A search can hold up to %(parts)s words and operators, and up to %(chars)s characters."
msgstr "Iskanje lahko zadrži do %(parts)s besed in operaterjev ter do %(chars)s znakov."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A search only finds what you could see anyway: your word filter, blocks, mutes and private guilds all still apply. A search for one account (<code>%(from_op)s</code>) shows their posts even if you muted them."
msgstr "Iskanje najde le tisto, kar lahko vidite: vaša beseda filter, bloki, nemi in zasebne guldne še vedno velja. Iskanje enega računa (<code>%(from_op)s</code>Tudi če ste jih utišali."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A successful refresh will result in the following response:"
msgstr "Uspešna osvežitev bo povzročila naslednji odziv:"

#, glossary, machine, plain1
msgid "About"
msgstr "O nas"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "About - %(site)s"
msgstr "O %(site)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Access tokens expire one hour after they are issued. To maintain ongoing access, you will need to use the refresh token to obtain a new access token."
msgstr "Žetoni za dostop potečejo eno uro po izdaji. Za ohranitev stalnega dostopa, boste morali uporabiti osvežitveni žeton, da bi dobili nov dostop žeton."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Accounts that post by themselves, approved by the site's admins."
msgstr "Račune, ki so jih sami objavili."

#, machine, plain1
