#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Guildmasters cannot delete or remove content that isn't theirs. They can \"Hide\" a post or comment from their own Guild if it breaks that Guild's rules - this only affects how the content appears within that one Guild; it remains untouched on the author's profile and in any other Guild it's been forwarded to. Only the content's own author (or %(site)s staff, for sitewide violations) can truly remove it everywhere."
msgstr "Moderatorji krivde ne morejo izbrisati ali odstraniti vsebine, ki ni njihova. Lahko \"skrijejo\" objavo ali komentirajo iz lastnega Guilda, če kršijo pravila Guilda - to vpliva le na to, kako se vsebina pojavlja znotraj tistega Guilda; ostane nedotaknjena na avtorjevem profilu in v kateremkoli drugem Guildu, kateremu je bila poslana. Samo lastni avtor vsebine (ali %(site)s osebje, za kršitve po vsej spletni strani) ga lahko resnično odstrani povsod."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Guildmasters who are permanently banned, or who have deactivated their %(site)s account, will always count as inactive, regardless of actual activity."
msgstr "Močni moderatorji, ki so trajno prepovedani ali so deaktivirali svoj račun %(site)s, se bodo vedno šteli za neaktivne, ne glede na dejansko aktivnost."

