#, machine, plain1
msgid "We also have some custom hooks for mentioning accounts, guilds, topics and curations. Note that these only work if what you mention actually exists: a `#word` that is not one of the site's topics, or an `&name` that is not a public curation, stays as plain text."
msgstr "Imamo tudi nekaj posebnih kavljev za omembo računov, cehov, tem in kuriranih virov. Upoštevajte, da delujejo le, če to, kar ste omenili, dejansko obstaja: a `#word` ki ni ena od tem spletnega mesta, ali `&name` to ni javna kurirana krma, ostane preprosto besedilo."

